g \u2192 H1: every one of the 12 possible orders was checked; another order ties on distance, and routed this one was no worse.","Ring: 38.0 m of cable, 18 bends, 0 crossings, 0.0 m overlapping itself."],"H2":["Serves Bedroom 3: 24.0 of 100 m\u00b2, 1 of 5 nodes.","Living next door could join, but it's with H1: that zoning has the same hub count and less cable.","Stands in Bedroom 3, at least 0.5 m from walls: of 1977 allowed spots in its zone, this one gives the shortest ring. The most open spot, which a simple method would pick, adds 2.3 m.","Visits H2 \u2192 N3 Bedroom 3 \u2192 H2 (with this few nodes there is only one ring).","Ring: 0.5 m of cable, 2 bends, 0 crossings, 0.2 m overlapping itself."],"H3":["Serves Bedroom 4: 15.5 of 100 m\u00b2, 1 of 5 nodes.","Living next door could join, but it's with H1: that zoning has the same hub count and less cable.","Stands in Bedroom 4, at least 0.5 m from walls: of 1033 allowed spots in its zone, this one gives the shortest ring.","Visits H3 \u2192 N4 Bedroom 4 \u2192 H3 (with this few nodes there is only one ring).","Ring: 0.5 m of cable, 2 bends, 0 crossings, 0.2 m overlapping itself."]},"hub_count":{"H":3,"by_area":2,"by_nodes":2,"alone":[]},"lower_bound":{"J":43.34,"gap_pct":16.5,"complete":true}}}